 &lt;span
 
 class="dark:text-neutral-300"
 
 &gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update 2026:&lt;/strong&gt; this setup has been superseded. I rebuilt my home server with Proxmox, a fully Git-driven deployment, and AI agents doing most of the work. Read about it in &lt;a href="https://dominikbritz.com/posts/my-ai-managed-home-server-in-2026/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;My AI-Managed Home Server in 2026&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A guide to setting up an old laptop as your new home server, powered by Ubuntu, Ansible, and Docker. It securely hosts videos, files, and photos. Add HTTPS everywhere, cloud backup and performance monitoring.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://dominikbritz.com/posts/2024-01-22-laptop-home-server/featured.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>